WEBVTT

00:11:56.598 --> 00:12:01.714
you think about how good that would feel, imagine it,

00:12:01.714 --> 00:12:06.344
and they are blessed with that experience for a year,

00:12:06.344 --> 00:12:07.833
and then they come home,

00:12:07.833 --> 00:12:10.820
and they are just back in society

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:13.659
like the rest of us are,

00:12:13.659 --> 00:12:16.085
not knowing who they can count on,

00:12:16.085 --> 00:12:21.262
not knowing who loves them, who they can love,

00:12:21.262 --> 00:12:23.853
not knowing exactly what anyone they know

00:12:23.853 --> 00:12:26.087
would do for them if it came down to it.

00:12:26.087 --> 00:12:29.673
That is terrifying.

00:12:29.673 --> 00:12:31.663
Compared to that,